achievement-fishach_ggghosts-desc = Some people say that being a ghost is better than being alive. You don't have much of a choice now.
achievement-fishach_grilledseasonedveteran-name = Grilled Seasoned Veteran
achievement-fishach_grilledseasonedveteran-desc = Easy come, easy go.
