achievement-fishach_killmekillmekillme-desc = Green, Mean, Honking Machine
achievement-fishach_letsplayglobalthermonuclearwar-name = Let's Play GLOBAL THERMONUCLEAR WAR
achievement-fishach_letsplayglobalthermonuclearwar-desc = Wouldn't you rather play chess?
