achievement-fishach_overextendedthejoke-name = Overextended The Joke
achievement-fishach_overextendedthejoke-desc = Speak no evil, hear no evil, see just errors
achievement-fishach_pleasejustendthepain-name = Please just end the pain
achievement-fishach_pleasejustendthepain-desc = Shuffling off this mortal coil while the getting's good.
achievement-fishach_seasonedveteran-name = Seasoned Veteran
achievement-fishach_seasonedveteran-desc = You could have gotten a bachelor's degree with this time.
achievement-fishach_sousvidegrilledseasonedveteran-name = Sous Vide Grilled Seasoned Veteran
achievement-fishach_sousvidegrilledseasonedveteran-desc = Good lord, you've spent half a year playing this game.
achievement-fishach_soyboy-name = Soyboy
achievement-fishach_soyboy-desc = Drank soymilk.
achievement-fishach_survivalofthefittest-name = Survival of the Fittest
achievement-fishach_survivalofthefittest-desc = Sun's out, guns out!
achievement-fishach_swarmbeaconcrusher-name = Swarm Beacon Crusher
achievement-fishach_swarmbeaconcrusher-desc = GET THEM OFF OF ME!
achievement-fishach_swarmbeaconkiller-name = Swarm Beacon Killer
achievement-fishach_swarmbeaconkiller-desc = GET THEM OFF OF ME!
achievement-fishach_thatwasstupidofyou-name = That was stupid of you.
achievement-fishach_thatwasstupidofyou-desc = (distant explosion noises)
achievement-fishach_thislousyachievement-name = This Lousy Achievement
achievement-fishach_thislousyachievement-desc = Not worth the effort
achievement-fishach_veteran-name = Veteran
achievement-fishach_veteran-desc = You've spent a lot of time on this game, have a reward!
achievement-fishach_whoosh-name = WHOOSH!
achievement-fishach_whoosh-desc = Pushing down on me, pressing down on you.
achievement-fishach_blooddrunkminercrusher-name = Blood-Drunk Miner Crusher
achievement-fishach_blooddrunkminercrusher-desc = I guess he couldn't handle his drink that well.
achievement-fishach_blooddrunkminerkiller-name = Blood-Drunk Miner Killer
achievement-fishach_blooddrunkminerkiller-desc = I guess he couldn't handle his drink that well.
achievement-fishach_bosskiller-name = Boss Killer
achievement-fishach_bosskiller-desc = You've come a long ways from asking how to switch hands.
achievement-fishach_bubblegumcrusher-name = Bubblegum Crusher
achievement-fishach_bubblegumcrusher-desc = I guess he wasn't made of candy after all
achievement-fishach_bubblegumkiller-name = Bubblegum Killer
achievement-fishach_bubblegumkiller-desc = I guess he wasn't made of candy after all
