achievement-fishach_colossuscrusher-desc = The bigger they are... the better the loot
achievement-fishach_colossuskiller-name = Colossus Killer
achievement-fishach_colossuskiller-desc = The bigger they are... the better the loot
achievement-fishach_drakecrusher-name = Drake Crusher
achievement-fishach_drakecrusher-desc = Now I can wear Rune Platebodies!
achievement-fishach_drakekiller-name = Drake Killer
achievement-fishach_drakekiller-desc = Now I can wear Rune Platebodies!
achievement-fishach_featofstrength-name = Feat of Strength
achievement-fishach_featofstrength-desc = If the rod is immovable, is it passing you or are you passing it?
achievement-fishach_hierophantcrusher-name = Hierophant Crusher
achievement-fishach_hierophantcrusher-desc = Hierophant, but not triumphant.
achievement-fishach_hierophantkiller-name = Hierophant Killer
achievement-fishach_hierophantkiller-desc = Hierophant, but not triumphant.
achievement-fishach_jackpot-name = Jackpot
achievement-fishach_jackpot-desc = Win a pulse rifle from an arcade machine
achievement-fishach_legioncrusher-name = Legion Crusher
achievement-fishach_legioncrusher-desc = We were many... now we are none.
achievement-fishach_legionkiller-name = Legion Killer
achievement-fishach_legionkiller-desc = We were many..now we are none.
achievement-fishach_yourlifebeforeyoureyes-name = Your Life Before Your Eyes
achievement-fishach_yourlifebeforeyoureyes-desc = Take a close look at hurtling space debris
achievement-fishach_roundandfull-name = Round and Full
achievement-fishach_roundandfull-desc = Well at least you aren't down the river, I hear they eat people there.
achievement-fishach_tendrilexterminator-name = Tendril Exterminator
achievement-fishach_tendrilexterminator-desc = Watch your step
achievement-fishach_thebestdriver-name = The Best Driver
achievement-fishach_thebestdriver-desc = 100 honks later
achievement-fishach_veryimportantpiscis-name = Very Important Piscis
achievement-fishach_veryimportantpiscis-desc = You can rest well now.
achievement-fishach_greentext-name = Greentext
achievement-fishach_greentext-desc = A winner is you!
achievement-fishach_10bux-name = :10bux:
achievement-fishach_10bux-desc = Entrusted with the secret.
achievement-fishach_10bux-secret = A tip for silence. Some secrets cost ten.
achievement-fishach_121jiggawatts-name = 1.21 Jiggawatts
achievement-fishach_121jiggawatts-desc = Complete the Chief Engineer objective of earning one hundred thousand (100000) credits from the PTL. Great Scott!
achievement-fishach_100mdash-name = 100M dash
achievement-fishach_100mdash-desc = Time for beer.
achievement-fishach_100mdash-secret = When the clock stops, raise a glass.
achievement-fishach_40k-name = 40K
achievement-fishach_40k-desc = Complete the Miner objective of fabricating 3 industrial armor suits by the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_421-name = 421
achievement-fishach_421-desc = Four, two, one — and the house remembers.
achievement-fishach_421-secret = Four. Two. One. The house always remembers.
achievement-fishach_ahollyjollyspacemas-name = A Holly Jolly Spacemas
achievement-fishach_ahollyjollyspacemas-desc = Spent your Spacemas being beaten to death with toolboxes.
achievement-fishach_ahollyjollyspacemas-secret = Holiday cheer, delivered by steel and bruises.
achievement-fishach_ashockingdemise-name = A shocking demise
achievement-fishach_ashockingdemise-desc = As an Arcfiend, stop at least six hearts using Jolt. It is not cumulative; you must do this within a single round. Jolt costs 200 energy, so you also need to sap at least 1200 (6 x 200) energy. You get this medal at the end of the round, rather than the moment you reach six hearts stopped, so that the OOC medal announcement doesn't expose your presence.
achievement-fishach_adjutantonline-name = Adjutant Online
achievement-fishach_adjutantonline-desc = Good morning, Captain.
achievement-fishach_adjutantonline-secret = Good morning, Captain. Systems online.
achievement-fishach_banned-name = Banned
achievement-fishach_banned-desc = Heinous villainy.
achievement-fishach_banned-secret = Not a ban from admins — a different kind of exile.
achievement-fishach_bearhug-name = Bear Hug
achievement-fishach_bearhug-desc = A warm squeeze with cold consequences.
achievement-fishach_bearhug-secret = Warm embrace. Cold outcome.
achievement-fishach_bettertoburnoutthanfade-name = Better to burn out, than fade away
achievement-fishach_bettertoburnoutthanfade-desc = Complete the Scientist objective and Research Director objective of escaping on the emergency shuttle while on fire with the chemical Silver Sulfadiazine in your system.
achievement-fishach_billmasen-name = Bill Masen
achievement-fishach_billmasen-desc = Complete the Botanist objective of having three mutated plants alive at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_blackandblue-name = Black and Blue
achievement-fishach_blackandblue-desc = As in, your corpse is black and blue. Blue, because you're dead and aren't getting oxygen, and black, because you died with 400 seconds of Burning, at which point the tooltip for the status effects says you're 'extremely on fire'. Dying via the suicide command renders you ineligible for this medal.
achievement-fishach_blockstacker-name = Block Stacker
achievement-fishach_blockstacker-desc = Score 30,000 points on Robustris Pro.
achievement-fishach_bombiniismissing-name = Bombini is Missing!
achievement-fishach_bombiniismissing-desc = Someone small and loud went missing.
achievement-fishach_bombiniismissing-secret = Someone small and loud is not where they should be.
achievement-fishach_brownpants-name = Brown Pants
achievement-fishach_brownpants-desc = The medal's icon illustrates it very well: as a Captain, you must successfully insert the authentication disk into the Nuclear Operatives' nuclear bomb. The 'nuke ops' aren't going to let you do that without a fight, so if you want this medal, then follow the medal description and 'show no fear in the face of battle'! You cannot obtain this medal by inserting the auth disk into a micronuke(or its defended variant), even though that bomb also accepts the disk. The admin-spawned 'event nukes' don't work either. Only full-sized ones from the Nuclear Emergency mode count!
achievement-fishach_burythedead-name = Bury the Dead
achievement-fishach_burythedead-desc = Complete the Chaplain objective of having zero corpses on station at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_buttonpusher-name = Button Pusher
achievement-fishach_buttonpusher-desc = Seriously?
achievement-fishach_buttonpusher-secret = Curiosity has a big red habit.
achievement-fishach_call1800coder-name = Call 1-800-CODER
achievement-fishach_call1800coder-desc = runtime error: Cannot execute player.unlock_medal() (Cause Goonstation's code to return an error. This does not necessarily mean youвЂ™ll get an error message on your end. However, it does show up on the adminsвЂ™ log of runtimes/errors.)
achievement-fishach_captainslog-name = Captain's Log
achievement-fishach_captainslog-desc = Make it official. Stardate optional.
achievement-fishach_captainslog-secret = Stardate whatever. Make it official.
achievement-fishach_chevalierdusorbet-name = Chevalier du Sorbet
achievement-fishach_chevalierdusorbet-desc = Deliver the Magma King his Just Desserts
achievement-fishach_chevalierdusorbet-secret = A frozen title for a frozen crusade.
achievement-fishach_contributor-name = Contributor
achievement-fishach_contributor-desc = You cannot get this medal on your own. An admin has to give it to you. This medal is typically bestowed on people who have made major contributions to the game, such as by fixing dozens of bugs or doing lots of re-sprites. As the Goonhub description puts it, thanks <3
achievement-fishach_creamofthecrop-name = Cream of the Crop
achievement-fishach_creamofthecrop-desc = As a Wrestler complete all of your objectives.
achievement-fishach_damned-name = Добровольный финал
achievement-fishach_damned-desc = Die via the suicide command; just enter suicide in the command bar/text parser at the bottom of your screen. The command offers a lot of different ways to die depending on what objects you're holding, what devices you're next to, and whether you're a human, cyborg, etc., and they all make you eligible for the medal, so just pick one you like. Just go through with it; if you use the command but cancel at the prompt, you won't get the medal, so merely entering the command isn't enough.
achievement-fishach_dangerousgame-name = Dangerous Game
achievement-fishach_dangerousgame-desc = As a hunter collect enough a high enough value of skulls to complete your objective.
achievement-fishach_deadoraliveyourecoming-name = Dead or alive, you're coming with me
achievement-fishach_deadoraliveyourecoming-desc = Complete the Security Officer objective or Head of Security objective of having an antagonist in handcuffs on the escape shuttle at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_deepfreeze-name = Deep Freeze
achievement-fishach_deepfreeze-desc = it is absolutely famished...
achievement-fishach_deepfreeze-secret = The cold doesn't negotiate.
achievement-fishach_draculajr-name = Dracula Jr.
achievement-fishach_draculajr-desc = As a Vampire accumulate enough blood to complete the'Accumulate at least [number] units of blood in total' objective.
achievement-fishach_dui-name = DUI
achievement-fishach_dui-desc = Driving under the influence while on a MULEBot, specifically. Run someone over with a MULEBot while riding on it and while you have some ethanol in your system. One unit, ten, hundred, doesn't matter how much. This can hurt quite a lot, so if you're not an antagonist, don't do this without a good reason. (If you are an antag, go right ahead.)
achievement-fishach_expendable-name = Expendable
achievement-fishach_expendable-desc = Die as a Revolutionary, specifically a regular one, not a Head Revolutionary. If you died via the suicide verb, it doesn't count towards this medal, but otherwise, it doesn't matter how you go, comrade.
achievement-fishach_felldownthestairs-name = Fell down the stairs
achievement-fishach_felldownthestairs-desc = Die while handcuffed. Again, it doesn't matter how you die, so long as you didn't use the suicide command for it (which is somewhat of a shame since cuffs have a unique suicide.) Having shackles doesn't count for this, but zipties/plastic cuffs and silver handcuffs do, as do regular handcuffs, obviously. Since the code counts them as handcuffs, being duct-taped also works.
achievement-fishach_fish-name = Добро пожаловать за борт
achievement-fishach_fish-desc = Late join into an ongoing round for the first time.
achievement-fishach_foryourohmgood-name = For Your Ohm Good
achievement-fishach_foryourohmgood-desc = Get vaporized by walking into an extremely high-power power transmission laser. The laser needs somewhere in the range of at least 200 Megawatts to gib you.
achievement-fishach_formatcomplete-name = Format Complete
achievement-fishach_formatcomplete-desc = AI, what are your current laws?
achievement-fishach_formatcomplete-secret = Wipe complete. Personality optional.
achievement-fishach_funtimes-name = Fun Times
achievement-fishach_funtimes-desc = Participate in one of the contests on the forums. These used to be monthly, but now they're enacted on admin discretion. Contests usually last a few weeks, and the admins take care to announce them, so as long as you check back on the forums from time to time, you won't miss out.
achievement-fishach_glassceiling-name = Glass Ceiling
achievement-fishach_glassceiling-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective of having a non-assistant ID assigned to you at the end of the round. This ranges from easy to impossible depending on the presence of the Head of Personnel.
achievement-fishach_goawaybatin-name = Go away! 'Batin!
achievement-fishach_goawaybatin-desc = Frito Pendejo, public defender.
achievement-fishach_goawaybatin-secret = Shoo. The vents are not a hotel.
achievement-fishach_googone-name = Goo Gone
achievement-fishach_googone-desc = It's Good for the Gander
achievement-fishach_googone-secret = Now you see me. Now you don't.
achievement-fishach_goodfeasting-name = Good Feasting
achievement-fishach_goodfeasting-desc = As a werewolf, reach your objective number of victims fed on.
achievement-fishach_gorefest-name = Разборка по косточкам
achievement-fishach_gorefest-desc = Get gibbed. If you're unfamiliar with that term, it means your body basically explodes into a mess of body parts and assorted remains, often due to an explosion. It doesn't necessary have to be human remains; getting gibbed as a cyborg, critter, etc. counts. Unlike many other death-related medals, this one doesn't care if you used the suicide command.
achievement-fishach_guardingnome-name = Guardin' Gnome
achievement-fishach_guardingnome-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective of ensuring Gnome Chompski is on the emergency shuttle OR escape on the emergency shuttle as any role with Gnome Chompski in your inventory. Gnome Chompski can be found in hidden locations on several maps. Be careful not to lose sight of him! He teleports when he is out of sight.
achievement-fishach_guerrierdugelato-name = Guerrier Du Gelato
achievement-fishach_guerrierdugelato-desc = Complete Chapter II
achievement-fishach_guerrierdugelato-secret = Another frozen knight for the dessert wars.
achievement-fishach_helios-name = Helios
achievement-fishach_helios-desc = Just havin' a good time, chillin' out.
achievement-fishach_helios-secret = Too close to the sun — again.
achievement-fishach_hesdeadjim-name = He's dead, Jim
achievement-fishach_hesdeadjim-desc = Bones.
achievement-fishach_hesdeadjim-secret = Medical bay poetry. Flatline edition.
achievement-fishach_highfive-name = High Five!
achievement-fishach_highfive-desc = While there is indeed a high-five emote, you don't earn it via that. Instead, you need to shock someone with stun gloves.
achievement-fishach_highvoltage-name = 220 и точка
achievement-fishach_highvoltage-desc = Get electrocuted in some way; you don't necessarily have to die because of it. The game actually offers quite a few ways to earn this: getting shocked by a wire, an APC, or a door all work as you'd expect, but so does walking into an active singularity engine's containment field, getting zapped by a GuardBuddy with an Elektro-Arc tool module, and getting hit by any of the various Adventure Zone enemies that attack with electricity.
achievement-fishach_honkhonkmotherfu-name = honk HONK mother FU-
achievement-fishach_honkhonkmotherfu-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective of wearing at least one piece of Clown clothing at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_humanoidmustnotescape-name = HUMANOID MUST NOT ESCAPE
achievement-fishach_humanoidmustnotescape-desc = Die on the escape shuttle. Doesn't matter how, so long as it wasn't through the suicide command. Since the shuttle is so tightly packed, it's a frequent target for antagonists on a murder spree, so you might earn this medal without even trying to.
achievement-fishach_idontgiveashit-name = I don't give a shit
achievement-fishach_idontgiveashit-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective of having your butt by any means at the end of the round. A safe bet for having your butt removed is usually visiting Robotics though they may want it for reasons.
achievement-fishach_ihelped-name = I helped!
achievement-fishach_ihelped-desc = End a round as a Security Assistant.
achievement-fishach_ijustcleanedthat-name = I just cleaned that!
achievement-fishach_ijustcleanedthat-desc = Slip 'n slide.
achievement-fishach_ijustcleanedthat-secret = Fresh floor. Fresh regret.
achievement-fishach_ispy-name = I Spy
achievement-fishach_ispy-desc = I spy with my little eye.
achievement-fishach_ispy-secret = I spy with my little eye... something classified.
achievement-fishach_icarus-name = Icarus
achievement-fishach_icarus-desc = Flew too close!
achievement-fishach_icarus-secret = Wings of wax, station of steel.
achievement-fishach_identitytheft-name = Identity Theft
achievement-fishach_identitytheft-desc = Good thing these are not laminated.
achievement-fishach_identitytheft-secret = Your face, someone else's smile.
achievement-fishach_illuminated-name = Illuminated
achievement-fishach_illuminated-desc = Old-school chemist's club.
achievement-fishach_illuminated-secret = A lightbulb moment that burns.
achievement-fishach_imin-name = I'm In
achievement-fishach_imin-desc = Successfully gain superuser access on a TermOS terminal via the su command. The AI, Captain, Cyborgs, Head of Security, and Research Director all spawn with superuser access, and it's possible to spoof it via certain commands.
achievement-fishach_isitreallythattimeagain-name = Is it really that time again?
achievement-fishach_isitreallythattimeagain-desc = Gordon would approve.
achievement-fishach_isitreallythattimeagain-secret = The calendar laughs. You don't.
achievement-fishach_itsatrap-name = IT'S A TRAP
achievement-fishach_itsatrap-desc = BANG, bang!
achievement-fishach_itsatrap-secret = Admiral Ackbar sends his regards.
achievement-fishach_itsfrickinfreezinginhere-name = It's frickin' freezing in here, Mr. Bigglesworth
achievement-fishach_itsfrickinfreezinginhere-desc = Complete the Medical Doctor objective and Medical Director objective of having the Medical Objects#Cryogenic Healing Pod on and under 225K at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_itsjustafleshwound-name = It's just a flesh wound!
achievement-fishach_itsjustafleshwound-desc = Make it to Central Command (aka, CentCom) with a bullet (or more) embedded in you. The precise type doesn't matter, and you can have multiple bullets lodged in you. Shrapnel doesn't count.
achievement-fishach_itsnotdoortoheaven-name = It's not 'Door to Heaven'
achievement-fishach_itsnotdoortoheaven-desc = Complete the Engineer objective of having at least two functional command teleporters
achievement-fishach_itsnoteasybeinggreen-name = It's not easy being green
achievement-fishach_itsnoteasybeinggreen-desc = Your muscles hurt.
achievement-fishach_itsnoteasybeinggreen-secret = Kermit called. He wants his struggle back.
achievement-fishach_itsamemario-name = It'sa me, Mario
achievement-fishach_itsamemario-desc = It's-a you, in space.
achievement-fishach_itsamemario-secret = It's-a me... in space.
achievement-fishach_jimiheselden-name = Jimi Heselden
achievement-fishach_jimiheselden-desc = Ride a segway into outer space/ the sea. A reference to Jimi Heselden, an executive (but not founder or inventor) of Segway, Inc. who famously ran off a cliff while on a Segway. He died as a result of that, but you don't actually need to die to earn this medal, just enter space/sea.
achievement-fishach_law1dontbean-name = Law 1: Don't be an asshat
achievement-fishach_law1dontbean-desc = Asimov's laws were definitely behind, because ol' Isaac did not foresee a robot wearing someone's ass as a hat. As the medal image shows, you need to put a butt on the AI's core unit, which, by default, spawns in the AI Chamber.
achievement-fishach_leavenomanbehind-name = Leave no man behind!
achievement-fishach_leavenomanbehind-desc = The ultimate sacrifice.
achievement-fishach_leavenomanbehind-secret = Everyone goes home. Or else.
achievement-fishach_licensedarchaeologist-name = Licensed Archaeologist
achievement-fishach_licensedarchaeologist-desc = Complete the Scientist or Research Director objective of activating 10 artifacts in a single shift.
achievement-fishach_lifeuhfindsaway-name = Life, uh... finds a way
achievement-fishach_lifeuhfindsaway-desc = Complete the Geneticist objective and Medical Director objective of having at least 5 people scanned in the Clone Console. Cloning people does remove them from the list of people scanned, so it would be in good practice to scan anyone that is cloned.
achievement-fishach_lockblock-name = Lock Block
achievement-fishach_lockblock-desc = Made friends with a welder.
achievement-fishach_lockblock-secret = Access denied is a lifestyle.
achievement-fishach_manwithascan-name = Man with a Scan
achievement-fishach_manwithascan-desc = Complete the Engineer objective of having 10 or more objects scanned in the ruckingeur kit.
achievement-fishach_manhattanproject-name = Manhattan Project
achievement-fishach_manhattanproject-desc = Successfully destroy the station with a nuclear detonation as a Nuclear Operative
achievement-fishach_manynamesmanyfaces-name = Many names, many faces
achievement-fishach_manynamesmanyfaces-desc = As a Changeling, complete the Changeling objective'Absorb the DNA of at least [absorb_count] more crew members in addition to the one you started with, and escape on the shuttle alive.'
achievement-fishach_masterofunlocking-name = Master of Unlocking
achievement-fishach_masterofunlocking-desc = Performed the steps required to unlock the Good Ending from the solarium riddle.
achievement-fishach_masterofunlocking-secret = Keys, cards, and questionable ethics.
achievement-fishach_methisahellofa-name = Meth is a hell of a drug
achievement-fishach_methisahellofa-desc = Complete the Scientist objective and Research Director objective of ending the round with methamphetamine in your system.
achievement-fishach_misclick-name = Мимо лица — в плитку
achievement-fishach_misclick-desc = Pry up a floor tile from some flooring using a crowbar; this is specifically for intact flooring, so you can't get this by removing burnt or broken tiles. The joke is that people fighting with crowbars often miss and target the floor instead of their opponent, accidentally prying floor tiles instead of the other person's face.
achievement-fishach_missioncomplete-name = MISSION COMPLETE
achievement-fishach_missioncomplete-desc = As an Antagonist complete your objectives.
achievement-fishach_monkeyduty-name = Monkey Duty
achievement-fishach_monkeyduty-desc = Complete the 'Keep Monsieur Stirstir brigged but also make sure that he comes to absolutely no harm' Security Officer, Security Assistant, and Head of Security objective. This is quite difficult to do as monkeys tend to use tables to flip into walls and other objects. It would be best to check on Stirstir regularly and make sure they aren't hurt and haven't been taken or murdered by a Traitor.

# batch02
achievement-fishach_mostlyarmless-name = Mostly Armless
achievement-fishach_mostlyarmless-desc = When the round ends, you need to be at Central Command/CentCom with both your arms missing. You need to be playing a human to earn this one; while you can wind up a cyborg without any arms at round-end, it won't get you this medal.
achievement-fishach_mybolognahasafirstname-name = My Bologna Has A First Name
achievement-fishach_mybolognahasafirstname-desc = And it's O-NO HELP GET IT OFF GET IT OFF AAA
achievement-fishach_mybolognahasafirstname-secret = Oscar. Mayer. You know the rest.
achievement-fishach_neitherfashionablenoirstylish-name = Neither fashionable noir stylish
achievement-fishach_neitherfashionablenoirstylish-desc = Complete the Detective objective of wearing your coat, hat, and uniform at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_nero-name = Nero
achievement-fishach_nero-desc = Watching the world burn.
achievement-fishach_nero-secret = The station burns. Someone fiddles.
achievement-fishach_newtonscrew-name = Newton's Crew
achievement-fishach_newtonscrew-desc = Stare into the sun.
achievement-fishach_newtonscrew-secret = What goes up must... invent gravity jokes.
achievement-fishach_noahsshuttle-name = Noah's Shuttle
achievement-fishach_noahsshuttle-desc = Have 7 station pets on the shuttle when it arrives at Central Command. Station pets include pretty much every Critter(i.e. no monkeys) that has a name, e.g. Heisenbee, Sylvester, Jones the Cat, 'jons the catte', the Pool space seals--basically, if the end of round stats mentions they escaped on the shuttle at the end, it counts towards this medal. Pets from Pet Person do not count for this.
achievement-fishach_ohdoctor-name = Oh, Doctor!
achievement-fishach_ohdoctor-desc = Just the spot.
achievement-fishach_ohdoctor-secret = Oh, doctor! No, not that doctor.
achievement-fishach_olbuddyolpal-name = Ol' buddy ol' pal
achievement-fishach_olbuddyolpal-desc = I really admire how you stack the odds against yourself! Yeah, make things challenging!
achievement-fishach_olbuddyolpal-secret = Old friend. Older favor.
achievement-fishach_oldenemy-name = Old Enemy
achievement-fishach_oldenemy-desc = Tensions between Nanotrasen and the Syndicate are reaching a boiling point.
achievement-fishach_oldenemy-secret = Familiar face. Unfamiliar side.
achievement-fishach_onmyowneightspacelegs-name = On My Own (Eight) Space Legs
achievement-fishach_onmyowneightspacelegs-desc = Why do something yourself when someone else will happily do it for you?
achievement-fishach_onmyowneightspacelegs-secret = Eight legs, zero excuses.
achievement-fishach_onmyowntwospacelegs-name = On My Own Two (Space) Legs
achievement-fishach_onmyowntwospacelegs-desc = Complete the in-game tutorial, meaning the one you enter by clicking the Play Tutorial button in the server's lobby. More specifically, you need to kill the NPC clown at the end.
achievement-fishach_onearmedbandit-name = One Armed Bandit
achievement-fishach_onearmedbandit-desc = Особое условие по мотивам «One Armed Bandit».
achievement-fishach_onearmedbandit-secret = Pull the lever. Trust the odds. Don't.
achievement-fishach_originalsin-name = Original Sin
achievement-fishach_originalsin-desc = Take a bite
achievement-fishach_originalsin-secret = The first mistake tastes like fruit.
achievement-fishach_owmyballs-name = OW! MY BALLS!
achievement-fishach_owmyballs-desc = Some places just can't take the pain. Get groin-punched by Senator Death Badman as a result of ingesting mimicillium.
achievement-fishach_partyhard-name = Party Hard
achievement-fishach_partyhard-desc = Die next to a tube of (deployed) neon lining or with a glowstick(any kind) in your inventory while drunk. Any level of drunkenness is fine.
achievement-fishach_patchwork-name = Patchwork
achievement-fishach_patchwork-desc = Complete the Medical Doctor objective and Medical Director objective of having used ten or more medical patches on injured people in a single round. A person is only counted as injured if their health is below 90%. Patches applied to yourself don't count.
achievement-fishach_primordial-name = Primordial
achievement-fishach_primordial-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective of escaping on the escape shuttle as a monkey. This can easily be achieved by going to Genetics and requesting they turn you into a one.
achievement-fishach_primumnonnocere-name = Primum non nocere
achievement-fishach_primumnonnocere-desc = Complete the Medical Doctor objective and Medical Director objective of not preforming a single violent act the entire round. This means that you cannot punch, use a weapon, or shoot anyone even if it is in self defense. You can still disarm and grab people without breaking your oath.
achievement-fishach_professionalthief-name = Professional Thief
achievement-fishach_professionalthief-desc = As Spy Thief, complete your ' Steal at least X items in total via your uplink.' objective.
achievement-fishach_progenitor-name = Progenitor
achievement-fishach_progenitor-desc = Complete the Roboticist Doctor objective and Medical Director objective of having at least three living Cyborgs at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_puerilehumour-name = Puerile humour
achievement-fishach_puerilehumour-desc = Complete the Roboticist objective and Medical Director objective of having at least five buttbots on station at the end of the round. Getting you hands on butts should be easy considering that some Staff Assistants will sometimes come to you for this.
achievement-fishach_quitcloningaround-name = Quit Cloning Around
achievement-fishach_quitcloningaround-desc = Acquire more than 7 cloner defects, which means getting cloned multiple times. 'Diminishing reruns' indeed...
achievement-fishach_redhood-name = Red Hood
achievement-fishach_redhood-desc = There are two ways to earn this. The first is to get your head cut off through surgery. Getting decapitated via a katana or a suicide doesn't count. The second is to get your face disfigured due to mixing fluorosulfuric acid without a proper mask on or getting splashed with any of the various acids or grog.
achievement-fishach_reefermadness-name = Reefer Madness
achievement-fishach_reefermadness-desc = Complete the Botanist objective of having no Cannabis plants, seeds, or products inside botany at the end of the round. This does in fact have the obvious loop hole that you can simply grow and store your cannabis elsewhere on station or just move it all at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_remembertowashbehindtheantennae-name = Remember to Wash Behind the Antennae
achievement-fishach_remembertowashbehindtheantennae-desc = Особое условие по мотивам «Remember to Wash Behind the Antennae».
achievement-fishach_remembertowashbehindtheantennae-secret = Hygiene checklist for the chrome-skinned.
achievement-fishach_reservedparking-name = Reserved Parking
achievement-fishach_reservedparking-desc = Have the emergency shuttle land on you. You can't be in a pod, locker, or anything else that might protect you, meaning that you'll get gibbed by being squished.
achievement-fishach_rookiethief-name = Rookie Thief
achievement-fishach_rookiethief-desc = Bzzt.
achievement-fishach_rookiethief-secret = First steal. Soft gloves. Loud heart.
achievement-fishach_sheesh-name = Sheesh!
achievement-fishach_sheesh-desc = Особое условие по мотивам «Sheesh!».
achievement-fishach_sheesh-secret = Sheesh.
achievement-fishach_shitfest-name = Shit Fest
achievement-fishach_shitfest-desc = Blow yourself up with Empowered High-Pressure Intestines.
achievement-fishach_shitforbrains-name = Shit for brains
achievement-fishach_shitforbrains-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective of having your own butt on your head when you escape on the shuttle. A safe bet for having your butt removed is usually visiting Robotics though they may want it for reasons.
achievement-fishach_shutupandjam-name = Shut Up and Jam
achievement-fishach_shutupandjam-desc = The year is 2041.
achievement-fishach_shutupandjam-secret = Less talk. More noise.
achievement-fishach_silentrunning-name = Silent Running
achievement-fishach_silentrunning-desc = Complete the Roboticist objective and Medical Director objective of having at least five Medibots on station at the end of the round. This does include the Medibot named ' Head Surgeon' that sometimes can be seen in Medbay.
achievement-fishach_slowburn-name = Slow Burn
achievement-fishach_slowburn-desc = Complete the Chief Engineer and Engineer objective of having all furnaces on station running. Furnaces can be found in Engineering and sometimes the Sauna depending on the map.
achievement-fishach_smoothoperator-name = Smooth Operator
achievement-fishach_smoothoperator-desc = Complete the Medical Doctor objective and Medical Director objective of being completely unharmed when the escape shuttle leaves for Central Command.
achievement-fishach_spaceham-name = Space Ham
achievement-fishach_spaceham-desc = Porky.
achievement-fishach_spaceham-secret = Not the radio kind.
achievement-fishach_spaceshipoftheseus-name = Spaceship of Theseus
achievement-fishach_spaceshipoftheseus-desc = Despite all that, you're still in the same boat.
achievement-fishach_spaceshipoftheseus-secret = Replace every bolt. Is it still you?
achievement-fishach_spamhaus-name = Spamhaus
achievement-fishach_spamhaus-desc = Hi
achievement-fishach_spamhaus-secret = Inbox zero is a myth.
achievement-fishach_spotless-name = Spotless
achievement-fishach_spotless-desc = Complete the one of the Janitor objectives of keeping the Bar, Brig, or Medbay completely clean with no blood, gibs, oil, or other messes staining the floor at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_suitablehowabouttheoubliette-name = Suitable? How about the Oubliette?!
achievement-fishach_suitablehowabouttheoubliette-desc = Stuff someone down a brig chute.
achievement-fishach_survivor-name = Survivor
achievement-fishach_survivor-desc = Time for counseling?
achievement-fishach_survivor-secret = Still here. Somehow.
achievement-fishach_suspiciouscharacter-name = Suspicious Character
achievement-fishach_suspiciouscharacter-desc = Just who was that man, with the plan?
achievement-fishach_suspiciouscharacter-secret = Something about you sets off the sensors.
achievement-fishach_taxhaven-name = Tax Haven
achievement-fishach_taxhaven-desc = Complete the Quartermaster objective of accumulating a budget of 100K credits. This ranges from easy to difficult depending of how savvy you and your fellow QMs are with purchases and exports, how often you need to make purchases, and randomly stumbling upon high value items such as starstone or stamped gold bullion
achievement-fishach_territorialdefender-name = Territorial Defender
achievement-fishach_territorialdefender-desc = As a Space Phoenix, complete all your objectives.
achievement-fishach_thankyoubusdriver-name = Thank You, Bus Driver!
achievement-fishach_thankyoubusdriver-desc = It never hurts to be polite!
achievement-fishach_thankyoubusdriver-secret = Please hold on. Next stop: anywhere.
achievement-fishach_thattastedfunny-name = That tasted funny
achievement-fishach_thattastedfunny-desc = Eat a dish with manmeat that came from a Clown. Get it, honk honk? Alternatively, as a Werewolf, consume a Clown via the Maul victim ability.
achievement-fishach_thatsnomoonthats-name = That's no moon, that's a GOURMAND!
achievement-fishach_thatsnomoonthats-desc = Особое условие по мотивам «That's no moon, that's a GOURMAND!».
achievement-fishach_thatsnomoonthats-secret = That's no moon...
achievement-fishach_theforceisstrongwiththis-name = The Force is strong with this one
achievement-fishach_theforceisstrongwiththis-desc = *fwissshhhhhh*
achievement-fishach_theforceisstrongwiththis-secret = Wave your hand. Ignore the airlock.
achievement-fishach_themailalwaysgoesthrough-name = The mail always goes through
achievement-fishach_themailalwaysgoesthrough-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant and Technical Trainee objective of 'Escape on the shuttle alive wearing at least one piece of mail courier clothing.' This can be gotten by asking Cargo Bay if they have any mail/postmaster clothes, bugging a Mail Courier for their clothes, or finding it elsewhere.
achievement-fishach_thesyndicateconnection-name = The Syndicate Connection
achievement-fishach_thesyndicateconnection-desc = Complete the Traitor objective of rescuing Monsieur StirStir, the monkey wearing an orange beret and orange prisoner jumpsuit, from the brig and making sure they escape alive on the shuttle. This objective is complicated by the fact other traitors could have a conflicting objective.
achievement-fishach_thisobjectmenaceswithspikesof-name = This object menaces with spikes of...
achievement-fishach_thisobjectmenaceswithspikesof-desc = Make a custom mining tool with a Mining Power of at least 600. Doesn't matter which type of tool or materials used, just get it high as you can!
achievement-fishach_thisstationisours-name = This station is ours!
achievement-fishach_thisstationisours-desc = As a head revolutionary, live to see your revolution come to a success!
achievement-fishach_throughthefireandflames-name = Through the fire and flames
achievement-fishach_throughthefireandflames-desc = We carry on! While the name references the hit DragonForce song, getting this medal is much more mundane than its name or image might suggest. While on fire, you need to stop, drop, and roll by pressing the RESIST button on your HUD (Hotkey: Z for Goon WASD, C for /tg/style WASD). Clicking on the Burning status effect icon will attempt to make you do this automatically.
achievement-fishach_tinkerer-name = Tinkerer
achievement-fishach_tinkerer-desc = Особое условие по мотивам «Tinkerer».
achievement-fishach_tinkerer-secret = One more wire. What could go wrong?
achievement-fishach_tipsy-name = Tipsy
achievement-fishach_tipsy-desc = Complete the Detective objective of having ethanol in your system at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_tothestars-name = To the stars
achievement-fishach_tothestars-desc = As a Flockmind or Flocktrace who has been in the Flock some time, successfully transmit the Signal.
achievement-fishach_toocool-name = Too Cool
achievement-fishach_toocool-desc = Win one of the contests that occur on the forums. There used to be a contest every month, but now they're held basically whenever the admins feel like it. They usually announce these contests, and the window to submit entries usually lasts at least a week or more, so you don't have to worry about missing out if you check on the forums every so often.
achievement-fishach_toofasttoofurious-name = Too Fast Too Furious
achievement-fishach_toofasttoofurious-desc = Activate rocket shoes while on a wheelchair, like in that gif. This kills you.
achievement-fishach_trailofblood-name = Trail of Blood
achievement-fishach_trailofblood-desc = You have successfully solved the rather intriguing case of your family inheritance, enjoy your reward.
achievement-fishach_trailofblood-secret = Follow the red breadcrumbs.
achievement-fishach_tryjigglingthehandle-name = Try jiggling the handle
achievement-fishach_tryjigglingthehandle-desc = Особое условие по мотивам «Try jiggling the handle».
achievement-fishach_tryjigglingthehandle-secret = Have you tried turning it off and on again?
achievement-fishach_unlikethedirectoriwentto-name = Unlike the director, I went to college
achievement-fishach_unlikethedirectoriwentto-desc = Have your Clown Application approved on the forums or have a clown that has claimed the reward willingly give you a diploma.
achievement-fishach_unperson-name = Unperson
achievement-fishach_unperson-desc = Complete the Head of Personnel objective of being alive but not being on the station or escape level at the end of the round. This means you must be in either the Debris field, Mining level, Trench, or any adventure zone. Z-level
achievement-fishach_untappedpotential-name = Untapped Potential
achievement-fishach_untappedpotential-desc = Complete the Traitor objective of killing all other antagonists
achievement-fishach_vacuumsealed-name = Vacuum Sealed
achievement-fishach_vacuumsealed-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective of having a space suit in your inventory or be wearing it. NOTE:Diving suits also count as space suits for this medal.
achievement-fishach_vehicularmanslaughter-name = Vehicular Manslaughter
achievement-fishach_vehicularmanslaughter-desc = Drive a Space Pod/ minisub/ car into someone and do enough damage that they enter critical condition, which is when they hit below 0 health and start dying. While 'manslaughter' means the victim died (accidentally), the victim does not actually have to die for this to be earned.
achievement-fishach_virtualascension-name = Virtual Ascension
achievement-fishach_virtualascension-desc = Особое условие по мотивам «Virtual Ascension».
achievement-fishach_virtualascension-secret = Upload complete. Body optional.
achievement-fishach_wedidntstartthefire-name = We didn't start the fire
achievement-fishach_wedidntstartthefire-desc = Complete the Scientist objective and Research Director objective of ensuring that there are no burnt floors in Chemistry. Any tiles that happened to be burned by foolishness can easily be fixed with Crowbar and some floor tiles if you are feeling fancy.
achievement-fishach_weirdscience-name = Weird Science
achievement-fishach_weirdscience-desc = That's gross! That's sick! I am not digging up dead girls!
achievement-fishach_weirdscience-secret = Science! With jazz hands.
achievement-fishach_whatsthisboxdoinghere-name = What's this box doing here?
achievement-fishach_whatsthisboxdoinghere-desc = Complete the Staff Assistant objective and Medical Director objective of ensuring Head Surgeon, the Medibot/ cardboard box/Medibot in a cardboard box, escapes on the shuttle. The bot is normally found in Medbay.
achievement-fishach_whereweregoingwewon-name = Where we're going, we won't need eyes to see
achievement-fishach_whereweregoingwewon-desc = Complete the Scientist objective and Research Director objective'Create a portal to the void'.
achievement-fishach_wheresthesmokinggun-name = Where's the smoking gun?
achievement-fishach_wheresthesmokinggun-desc = Complete the Detective objective of smoking a cigarette at the end of the round.
achievement-fishach_wonk-name = Wonk
achievement-fishach_wonk-desc = Owl always love you
achievement-fishach_wonk-secret = Wonk.
achievement-fishach_wrathofthefather-name = Wrath of the Father
achievement-fishach_wrathofthefather-desc = Особое условие по мотивам «Wrath of the Father».
achievement-fishach_wrathofthefather-secret = Dad's not mad. Dad's disappointed. Violently.
achievement-fishach_yield-name = Yield
achievement-fishach_yield-desc = That is, yield to death. While dying, use the succumb command; you enter this via the text parser/command bar on the bottom. If you were dying because you used the suicide command earlier, it doesn't count.
achievement-fishach_youreameanone-name = You're a mean one...
achievement-fishach_youreameanone-desc = As a Grinch complete your objectives.
achievement-fishach_yourenoelminster-name = You're no Elminster!
achievement-fishach_yourenoelminster-desc = As a Wizard complete your objectives.
achievement-fishach_perfectchemistryblossom-name = Perfect chemistry blossom
achievement-fishach_perfectchemistryblossom-desc = Passed the chemistry tutorial with perfect purity!
achievement-fishach_rule1-name = Rule 1
achievement-fishach_rule1-desc = Call an admin this is ILLEGAL!!
achievement-fishach_secretsbehindthespiderdoor-name = Secrets behind the Spider Door
achievement-fishach_secretsbehindthespiderdoor-desc = You managed to open a gate into the mansus.
achievement-fishach_thejaredletooffruits-name = The Jared Leto of fruits
achievement-fishach_thejaredletooffruits-desc = Cantelopes dumb friend they insist on bringing to the party. The worst part of everything it is in.
achievement-fishach_abowldnewworld-name = A Bowl-d New World
achievement-fishach_abowldnewworld-desc = There's a lot of grisly ways to kick it on the Spinward Periphery, but drowning to death in a toilet probably wasn't what you had in mind. Probably.
achievement-fishach_blooddrunkminerskilled-name = Blood-Drunk Miners Killed
achievement-fishach_blooddrunkminerskilled-desc = You've killed HOW many?
achievement-fishach_bosseskilled-name = Bosses Killed
achievement-fishach_bosseskilled-desc = You've killed HOW many?
achievement-fishach_bubblegumskilled-name = Bubblegums Killed
achievement-fishach_bubblegumskilled-desc = You've killed HOW many?
achievement-fishach_colossuskilled-name = Colossus Killed
achievement-fishach_colossuskilled-desc = You've killed HOW many?
achievement-fishach_demonicfrostminercrusher-name = Demonic-Frost Miner Crusher
achievement-fishach_demonicfrostminercrusher-desc = Definitely harder than the Blood-Drunk Miner.
achievement-fishach_demonicfrostminerkiller-name = Demonic-Frost Miner Killer
achievement-fishach_demonicfrostminerkiller-desc = Definitely harder than the Blood-Drunk Miner.
achievement-fishach_diskplease-name = Disk, Please!
achievement-fishach_diskplease-desc = Is the man currently pointing a loaded rocket launcher at your head point blank really dumb enough to pull the trigger? Do you really want to find out?
achievement-fishach_drakeskilled-name = Drakes Killed
achievement-fishach_drakeskilled-desc = You've killed HOW many?
achievement-fishach_gettinganupgrade-name = Getting an upgrade
achievement-fishach_gettinganupgrade-desc = Make your first unique material item!
achievement-fishach_hagottem-name = HA, GOTTEM
achievement-fishach_hagottem-desc = Made you look!
achievement-fishach_helbitaljanken-name = Helbitaljanken
achievement-fishach_helbitaljanken-desc = You janked hard
achievement-fishach_hierophantskilled-name = Hierophants Killed
achievement-fishach_hierophantskilled-desc = You've killed HOW many?
achievement-fishach_howdoiswitchhands-name = How Do I Switch Hands???
achievement-fishach_howdoiswitchhands-desc = If you saw someone casually club themselves upside the head with a toolbox anywhere in the galaxy but here, you'd probably be pretty concerned for them.
achievement-fishach_iwasateenageanarchist-name = I Was a Teenage Anarchist
achievement-fishach_iwasateenageanarchist-desc = You were doing a great job sticking it to the system until that vending machine decided to fight back.
achievement-fishach_kkkiiilllmmmeee-name = KKKiiilll mmmeee
achievement-fishach_kkkiiilllmmmeee-desc = You were a little too ambitious, but hey, I guess you're still alive?
achievement-fishach_legendaryminer-name = Legendary miner
achievement-fishach_legendaryminer-desc = No mere rock can stop me!
achievement-fishach_legionskilled-name = Legions Killed
achievement-fishach_legionskilled-desc = You've killed HOW many?
achievement-fishach_longshift-name = Long shift
achievement-fishach_longshift-desc = Well, that didn't take long.
achievement-fishach_lookoutsir-name = Look Out, Sir!
achievement-fishach_lookoutsir-desc = Either awarded for making the ultimate sacrifice for your comrades, or a really dumb attempt at grenade jumping.
achievement-fishach_mistersandman-name = Mister Sandman
achievement-fishach_mistersandman-desc = Mechanically speaking, there's no real benefit to being unconscious during surgery. Weird how insistent this doctor is about using the N2O anyway though, huh?
achievement-fishach_mywatchliststatusisnotimportant-name = My Watchlist Status is Not Important
achievement-fishach_mywatchliststatusisnotimportant-desc = You may be under the impression that violent video games are a harmless pastime, but the security and medical personnel swarming your location with batons and knockout gas look like they disagree.
achievement-fishach_oneleanmeancleaningmachine-name = One Lean, Mean, Cleaning Machine
achievement-fishach_oneleanmeancleaningmachine-desc = How does it feel to know that your workplace values a mop bucket on wheels more than you?
achievement-fishach_timewaster-name = Time waster
achievement-fishach_timewaster-desc = Speak no evil, hear no evil, see just errors
achievement-fishach_wendigocrusher-name = Wendigo Crusher
achievement-fishach_wendigocrusher-desc = You've now ruined years of mythical storytelling.
achievement-fishach_wendigokiller-name = Wendigo Killer
achievement-fishach_wendigokiller-desc = You've now ruined years of mythical storytelling.
achievement-fishach_wendigoskilled-name = Wendigos Killed
achievement-fishach_wendigoskilled-desc = You've killed HOW many?
achievement-fishach_allthatperish-name = All that perish
achievement-fishach_allthatperish-desc = Place of a different being, different time. Everything ends there... but maybe it is just the beginning?
achievement-fishach_allwithintheoreticallimits-name = All Within Theoretical Limits
achievement-fishach_allwithintheoreticallimits-desc = I never thought I'd see a resonance cascade, let alone prevent one...
achievement-fishach_archmage-name = Archmage
achievement-fishach_archmage-desc = Made a big impression on the station with your phenomenal cosmic power.
achievement-fishach_ascension-name = Ascension
achievement-fishach_ascension-desc = Caedite eos. Novit enim Dominus qui sunt eius.
achievement-fishach_assistantvictory-name = Assistant Victory
achievement-fishach_assistantvictory-desc = If you got killed instead of someone more important, you just flexed the true strength of your \
achievement-fishach_centcomgradeacceptableservice-name = Centcom Grade: Acceptable Service
achievement-fishach_centcomgradeacceptableservice-desc = Well, it'll do! You and your department did just fine.
achievement-fishach_centcomgradeexemplaryservice-name = Centcom Grade: Exemplary Service
achievement-fishach_centcomgradeexemplaryservice-desc = Centcom is very impressed with your department!
achievement-fishach_centcomgradeshittyservice-name = Centcom Grade: Shitty Service
